    "description": "Welcome to *CubeAway - 3DPuzzle*.\nFeaturing a simple yet beautiful design, this logic puzzle game will test your thinking skills, concentration, and creativity.\nCarefully navigate the intricately intertwined maze of arrows and remove them all without making a single mistake.\nEach stage presents a unique challenge that combines logical thinking, timing, and spatial awareness.\n\nEnjoy a rewarding puzzle experience that requires both intuition and strategic thinking.\n\nThe goal is simple, but you must never let your guard down.\nRemove the arrows in the correct order to clear them all from the cube.\nAnticipate your next move, visualize chain reactions, and discover the optimal sequence.\n\nWhether you’re a puzzle veteran or a beginner,\n“CubeAway - 3DPuzzle” delivers two distinct pleasures: the joy of thinking and a sense of calm tranquility.\n\nEach puzzle is a story that demands logic, patience, and precision.\nCan you remove all the arrows placed on the six sides?\n\nTest your mental agility in a quiet, beautiful world.\n“CubeAway - 3DPuzzle” will become your new “healing time for the mind.”",
